  "description": {
   "en": "Kyuhyun comes out after mistakenly posting a photo of himself kissing his ex-boyfriend in a group chat . \"It's ruined. Someone's already seen it.\" Terrified and after a sleepless night, he walks into class and meets Kibeom's insistent gaze.\n\"Hey, what time does your class finish today?\"\nSeeing each other more and more often after this simple question, Kyuhyun's fear gradually turns into excitement, and the mood between them changes in an unexpected direction...\n\"Date me, I'll become the person you'd love.\""
  },
